OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns grow for hillwalker from
OL,4,ABelgium missing on Isle of Skye
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are growing concerned for a
OL,7,F45-year-old tourist who went missing
OL,8,Fwhile hillwalking on the Isle of Skye.
OL,10,FHector Patemore, who lives in Belgium,
OL,11,Fwas last seen at about 10:45 on Sunday
OL,12,Fwhen he left Glenbrittle Youth Hostel
OL,13,Fto begin his walk.
OL,15,FHe planned to climb Sgurr Na
OL,16,FBanachdich, coming down via Coire Na
OL,17,FBanachdich in the Cuillin Mountain
OL,18,Farea, but failed to return to his
OL,19,Faccommodation and has not been in
OL,20,Fcontact with his family.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
